  "_script": "Good morning, and this is the Btown Brief, out loud.\n\nThe school board meets tonight with a budget gap to close, and the first proposal on the table would trim the late bus. If your kids ride it, tonight is the night to say so.\n\nThe lake is still warm for the middle of October, and the scientists who watch it say that matters for what grows in it next summer.\n\nThat’s the Brief for this morning. Every story is on the Wire in All Day. This summary is read by an AI voice."
